11
01:25:15,000 --> 01:25:21,000
Robert the Bruce is a 2019 British epic historical fiction war film directed
by Richard Gray concerning the renowned king of the same name.

12
01:33:00,000 --> 01:33:06,000
It is a spin-off/sequel to Mel Gibson's Braveheart (1995), with
Angus Macfadyen reprising his role as Robert the Bruce.

13
01:40:45,000 --> 01:40:51,000
A character-driven ensemble piece, it portrays Robert's relationship with a peasant family as a
galvanising influence on his struggle for independence and his ensuing reign.

14
01:48:30,000 --> 01:48:36,000
The film explores themes of scotland, family secrets,
king, 14th century, mother son relationship.

15
01:56:15,000 --> 01:56:21,000
The tone is emotional.
